{"starting_node":-4.0,"textboxes":[{"x":656.0,"y":592.0,"connect0_ID":46.0,"portrait_ind":5.0,"ID":0.0,"text":"Hee hee!","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)"},{"x":1008.0,"y":592.0,"portrait_ind":57.0,"ID":1.0,"text":"<donotdestroy>Whu-?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":736.0,"y":720.0,"portrait_ind":58.0,"ID":2.0,"text":"That's pretty cool.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1248.0,"y":544.0,"connect0_ID":4.0,"portrait_ind":43.0,"ID":3.0,"text":"What the hell<nopause>,<yespause> man!?<break>WHAT THE HELL!?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1152.0,"y":704.0,"connect0_ID":5.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":4.0,"text":"We got a call from 'da Wiz.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1392.0,"y":704.0,"connect0_ID":6.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":5.0,"text":"<auto 5>Said you was-","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1568.0,"y":688.0,"portrait_ind":3.0,"ID":6.0,"text":"<blip 1>Heheh. <blip 2>He said you guys were messin' stuff up, <blip 1>heheheh.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_dennis)"},{"x":1152.0,"y":800.0,"connect0_ID":9.0,"portrait_ind":11.0,"ID":8.0,"text":"Dude, we rehearsed this. I do the talking.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1456.0,"y":800.0,"connect0_ID":10.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"ID":9.0,"text":"<blip 2>Oh, yeah. <blip 1>Heheh<blip 2>. I forgot. My bad. <blip 1>Heheh.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_dennis)"},{"x":1840.0,"y":800.0,"connect0_ID":11.0,"portrait_ind":2.0,"ID":10.0,"text":"Yeah, that IS your bad. How many times do we have to go over this?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2448.0,"y":800.0,"portrait_ind":9.0,"ID":11.0,"text":"<auto 25>Are you STUPID or something?<pause 8> Rhetorical. <pitch 1.16>Of COURSE YOU ARE-","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1168.0,"y":1024.0,"connect0_ID":13.0,"portrait_ind":2.0,"ID":12.0,"text":"Ugh.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_jade)"},{"x":1296.0,"y":1024.0,"portrait_ind":49.0,"ID":13.0,"text":"Wait... The Wizard sent you guys?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1168.0,"y":1120.0,"connect0_ID":16.0,"portrait_ind":17.0,"ID":15.0,"text":"Ahem.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1312.0,"y":1120.0,"connect0_ID":17.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"ID":16.0,"text":"YEP. That's right! He sent us. And you know WHY he sent us?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1712.0,"y":1120.0,"connect0_ID":18.0,"portrait_ind":24.0,"ID":17.0,"text":"Ummm. Because you look like him?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)"},{"x":1984.0,"y":1136.0,"connect0_ID":19.0,"portrait_ind":13.0,"ID":18.0,"text":"What? Nuh-uh.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2144.0,"y":1136.0,"connect0_ID":20.0,"portrait_ind":17.0,"ID":19.0,"text":"No I don't.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2304.0,"y":1136.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"ID":20.0,"text":"He sent us because this was a job for no other than...","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1248.0,"y":1264.0,"connect0_ID":22.0,"portrait_ind":97.0,"ID":21.0,"text":"<pitch 1.2>THE BLACK KNIVES!?!?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)"},{"x":1472.0,"y":1264.0,"connect0_ID":23.0,"portrait_ind":6.0,"ID":22.0,"text":"Yep, that's right. Heh, came up with the name myself.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1856.0,"y":1264.0,"connect0_ID":24.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":23.0,"text":"<blip 2>Well, actually, it was more of a team effort.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_dennis)"},{"x":2224.0,"y":1264.0,"connect0_ID":49.0,"portrait_ind":9.0,"ID":24.0,"text":"Dennis I swear to god I will cut you up into little cubes.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1184.0,"y":1408.0,"connect0_ID":27.0,"portrait_ind":2.0,"ID":26.0,"text":"What Lance is trying to say... is the Wizard hired us to take out the trash.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_jade)"},{"x":1600.0,"y":1408.0,"connect0_ID":28.0,"portrait_ind":46.0,"ID":27.0,"text":"?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1728.0,"y":1408.0,"connect0_ID":29.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":28.0,"text":"...","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_jade)"},{"x":1808.0,"y":1408.0,"connect0_ID":30.0,"portrait_ind":1.0,"ID":29.0,"text":"You're the trash.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_jade)"},{"x":1968.0,"y":1408.0,"connect0_ID":31.0,"portrait_ind":47.0,"ID":30.0,"text":"!","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":2112.0,"y":1408.0,"connect0_ID":32.0,"portrait_ind":87.0,"ID":31.0,"text":"<pitch 1.2>WE'RE GONNA DIE.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)"},{"x":2336.0,"y":1408.0,"connect0_ID":48.0,"portrait_ind":7.0,"ID":32.0,"text":"What the- JADE!? You're talking too!?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2352.0,"y":1552.0,"connect0_ID":34.0,"portrait_ind":4.0,"ID":33.0,"text":"<noskip>I guess EVERYONE's the leader today. Even you, Snake!","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2064.0,"y":1552.0,"connect0_ID":35.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":34.0,"text":"<col red><shake 1>...","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_snake)"},{"x":1888.0,"y":1552.0,"connect0_ID":36.0,"portrait_ind":18.0,"ID":35.0,"text":"Ok maybe not you.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1520.0,"y":1552.0,"connect0_ID":37.0,"portrait_ind":23.0,"ID":36.0,"text":"Why are you listening to the Wizard? He's an old green guy. Are you stupid?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1120.0,"y":1568.0,"connect0_ID":38.0,"portrait_ind":8.0,"ID":37.0,"text":"You will NOT speak ill of the ALMIGHTY WIZARD.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1104.0,"y":1664.0,"connect0_ID":39.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":38.0,"text":"You know nothing of his power. He's been around longer than you could ever know.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1552.0,"y":1680.0,"connect0_ID":40.0,"portrait_ind":2.0,"ID":39.0,"text":"You've intervened with his plans long enough. Soon, we'll be on top with him...","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":1952.0,"y":1712.0,"portrait_ind":16.0,"ID":40.0,"text":"So stay out of our way...","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2688.0,"y":1648.0,"connect0_ID":54.0,"portrait_ind":51.0,"ID":41.0,"text":".","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":2880.0,"y":1776.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":43.0,"text":"<no_portrait><center><transparent><auto 999999>   Let's dance.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1056.0,"y":1264.0,"connect0_ID":21.0,"portrait_ind":27.0,"ID":44.0,"text":"You seein' this, Bridget?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":736.0,"y":832.0,"portrait_ind":13.0,"ID":45.0,"text":"WHAT THE-","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":832.0,"y":592.0,"connect0_ID":1.0,"portrait_ind":94.0,"ID":46.0,"text":"Buster, look!","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)"},{"x":1696.0,"y":1840.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":47.0,"text":"So prepare to <col red><col white><col white><col white><col red><col red><col red><col red><col red><col red><col white>feel the wrath...<break>of The Black Knives.","portrait":-4.0},{"x":2768.0,"y":1472.0,"connect0_ID":33.0,"portrait_ind":11.0,"ID":48.0,"text":"Has EVERYONE forgotten their roles!?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2624.0,"y":1264.0,"portrait_ind":8.0,"ID":49.0,"text":"<auto 5><pitch 1.16>I'M GONNA-","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2160.0,"y":1664.0,"connect0_ID":52.0,"portrait_ind":3.0,"ID":51.0,"text":"<textspd 0.3><pitch 0.9><col red>Or you'll get <shake 2>carved<shake 0> like a <shake 2>turkey<shake 0>.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_lance)"},{"x":2576.0,"y":1648.0,"connect0_ID":41.0,"portrait_ind":44.0,"ID":52.0,"text":"...","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)"},{"x":2832.0,"y":1680.0,"portrait_ind":38.0,"ID":54.0,"text":"Alright. Fine.<break>You wanna dance?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"}],"camx":2127.876708984375,"cam_zoom_count":2.0,"camy":1592.875732421875,"portraits":[],"events":[],"choices":[],"ID_TOTAL":56.0,"comments":[]}